+  the bundle.
+* Rust 1.98.0 via rustup; **every new shell needs
+  `export PATH=/home/user/.cargo/bin:$PATH`**.
+* `gcc-multilib` + `libc6-dev-i386` must be reinstalled after a wipe or the
